{{Documentation}}
Used for templatestyles calls so you only need to call them once. Can take multiple arguments.

<pre>
{{TemplateStyles once|Lineup/styles.css|CatCombo/styles.css}}
</pre>

Using this massively reduces the unstrip post-expand size of a page compared to plain templatestyles, if the template is used a lot. Also if any template is that much of a problem then you may also need to directly invoke the module rather than using this template. [[Template:Stage]] is an example.